- нахождения одной и той же задачи в разных папках одновременно; 
- статусов задач настраиваемых вместо выполнено;

I use it to organize my cosplays! Here&#39;s how:
Step 1. Create new list. Title it &#34;(character name) cosplay&#34;
Step 2. Create a new reminder and name it &#34;to buy&#34;
Step 3. Go to the info and click subtasks 
Step 4. List all the things you need to buy for the cosplay. You can also make a new one for things to make! 
Good luck!

